config AK_GMAC
	tristate "Anyka EV200/EV300/EV330 Synopsys GMAC Ethernet"
	depends on ARCH_AK && OF
	depends on MACH_AK39EV330 || MACH_AK3918EV200
	select CRC32
	help
	  The Synopsys GMAC in the AK3918EV200, AK3918EV300 and AK39EV330
	  parts (anyka,ak39ev330-ethernet), from the Cloud39EV300 SDK's
	  driver. The MAC interface comes from the device tree's phy-mode,
	  RMII unless "mii" is given. The module is ak_gmac.

	  The first AK39 generation's older MAC is AK_ETHERNET instead.
